    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of Endless Pinball, the addictive pinball game where you can challenge your skills and see how far you can go!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you play as a pinball and your mission is to travel as far as possible without getting stuck or hitting any obstacles. The pinball rolls automatically, so your only job is to tap the left or right side of the screen to control its movement and avoid the walls and obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you progress, the game becomes more challenging with faster speeds and more complex obstacles. You'll encounter moving obstacles, narrow passages, and even gravity-defying loops that will test your reflexes and strategic thinking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEndless Pinball features stunning graphics and a variety of themes, each with their own unique obstacles and challenges. You can unlock new pinball designs and themes by earning points and achieving high scores.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEndless Pinball is the ultimate test of skill and endurance, perfect for those who love challenging and addictive games. Download it now and see how far you can go!",
